arguments.desc:
Structured filter tree supporting AND/OR nesting.

Two node types:
  leaf:  {"type":"leaf",  "field":"...", "op":"...", "value":...}
  group: {"type":"group", "operator":"and"|"or", "conditions":[...]}

Available fields: address, custom_var, hostgroup, name, state
Operators: eq, gte, in, lte, neq, regex

Examples:
  # Hosts DOWN in HG_AGILE:
  {"type":"group","operator":"and","conditions":[
    {"type":"leaf","field":"hostgroup","op":"eq","value":"HG_AGILE"},
    {"type":"leaf","field":"state","op":"eq","value":"down"}
  ]}

  # Hosts in HG_AGILE OR with KERNEL=windows:
  {"type":"group","operator":"or","conditions":[
    {"type":"leaf","field":"hostgroup","op":"eq","value":"HG_AGILE"},
    {"type":"leaf","field":"custom_var","op":"eq","value":{"var":"KERNEL","val":"windows"}}
  ]}

